":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"KlZvP_k_VEJV0G-6tTqnqQ","review_id":"9QCLO03pX1qRi8lf_LbIag","date":"2019-11-30T05:27:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9410061836242676,"text_excerpt":"We stopped in here for a late lunch early dinner. The place has a great location right in the middle of bourbon street. The interior is very nice and the service was good. The food was standard Cajun food and was absolutely delicious with a lot of flavor. We got a ton of food (another plus)."},{"business_id":"KlZvP_k_VEJV0G-6tTqnqQ","review_id":"L1Sq1DW5HkOM_maKj_n1kw","date":"2019-01-12T18:43:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372048377990723,"text_excerpt":"We had a 'few' drinks and were in need of food. Neither of us had oysters so we ventured to try them as well as alligator bites and added some New Orlean bits to finish. Our waitress was fantastic and recommended added crab to our char-grilled oysters. We split 1/2 dozen of crab and just char-grilled. Absolutely wonderful recommendation, but wish we had all six with crab. The gators bites we good but chewy like gator is. The NO bits.....yummy! Overall, great service and food. Location on Burbon so its convenient as well. Enjoy!"},{"business_id":"KlZvP_k_VEJV0G-6tTqnqQ","review_id":"_apaQ4KGYqsqZRlwsOQwjA","date":"2018-01-26T15:30:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9307225942611694,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in on a night out in bourbon and as a local I expected this place to be a yucky tourist trap. The service was really poor and they definitely kept us waiting way too long on a pretty empty night, but the food was great! They exceeded my expectations in food for sure. I had a dozen chargrilled oysters for dinner and my friend had the blackened chicken. We both loved our meals. Also, they have a gluten free menu available if you ask for it!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"KlZvP_k_VEJV0G-6tTqnqQ","photo_id":"10xLh6iOcQgZvmuO5eKG_A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/10xLh6iOcQgZvmuO5eKG_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8373128771781921},{"business_id":"KlZvP_k_VEJV0G-6tTqnqQ","photo_id":"CTN1P3rOu6vvulRrpDndWg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/CTN1P3rOu6vvulRrpDndWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.825567364692688},{"business_id":"KlZvP_k_VEJV0G-6tTqnqQ","photo_id":"gGdyFSh-NYjq6UcqioBV2w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/gGdyFSh-NYjq6UcqioBV2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8205002546310425},{"business_id":"KlZvP_k_VEJV0G-6tTqnqQ","photo_id":"7WjcfSCUw9IfVegZcni58A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7WjcfSCUw9IfVegZcni58A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7913480997085571},{"business_id":"KlZvP_k_VEJV0G-6tTqnqQ","photo_id":"q8Ctkt1bb6MmAHBI4iRBMw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/q8Ctkt1bb6MmAHBI4iRBMw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7851271629333496}]},"notebook_case":null}
